"""Prepared torch oracle for not_equal (reference-as-solution phase).

Semantics follow the frozen Definition ``definitions/not_equal.json``:
``aten::not_equal.Tensor(Tensor self, Tensor other) -> Tensor`` computes the
elementwise inequality of two broadcast-compatible tensors and returns a new
``torch.bool`` tensor. ``effects.mutates`` and ``effects.returns_alias_of`` are
both empty for this signature, so this oracle must not write into either
operand and must not return one of them.

The oracle is the native aten comparison, which is also the frozen master
test's expected path, so dtype promotion, broadcasting, NaN semantics
(NaN != NaN -> True) and the result device/dtype are exactly the aten ones.
It deliberately imports neither ``flag_gems`` nor ``flag_gems.ops`` so the
injected override can never re-enter the public export it replaces.
"""

import torch


def run(self, other):
    """Return ``not_equal(self, other)`` as a new ``torch.bool`` tensor."""
    return torch.not_equal(self, other)
